  "calibration": "isotropic: one scale from the published 728.47 mm width over the plate outline's 2584 px; every round control is round in the figure (knob rings 53.0 x 52.3 px, pads 77.8 x 76.8, jog bezel 569.2 x 561.6), so no separate y scale is fitted. The plate outline is 1504 px = 424.0 mm of the published 496.82 mm depth; the remaining 72.8 mm is the sloped front face (drawn below the plate line with its headphone jack and knob) and the rear connector edge, neither carrying a top-panel control. y 0 is the plate's rear edge: a remainder behind it would shift every control equally.",
